LUMA SUMMARY:
QuackSink 1.0 is born. The new name/version/identity is announced, then Cozmo immediately catches that the promised relay-display scroll fix is absent from the actual code. The session establishes the discipline of testing one change at a time and using the archive itself to prove what version was really running.
